// |----------------------------|-------------------------------------------------------------|
// | 0x1c string                | `+0x00` data, `+0x04` size, `+0x08` capacity, `+0x0c..+0x1b` inline buffer |
// | log stream                 | `+0x00` vftable, `+0x04` path string, `+0x20` handle, `+0x24` append byte, `+0x28` pending deque |
